I've won, I've won.  Twice allready and who knows many times to come because
this game is *fun*.  Both times I did a little polypoling which gave me great
help to continue.  What I did was clean up lots of levels, including the Medusa
level and then pile up all the shit I could find.  Once I had cleaned out a
soldier's barack which gave me all the rings and all the special armour.  The other
time I ended up with 6 scrolls of enchant armour and 2 potions of gain level.

However:  Why is it that enchant armour sometimes enchants by one and blesses too
but not more.  I don't care about the blessing, I just want to get my AC as 
low as possible, so why don't enchant armour and enchant weapon act alike?
Enchant weapon is powerful but enchant armour is not.

Also, several times I had donated 50,000 or 60,000 zorkmids to a priest so when 
I encountered a new priest I figured to kill the first one and then grab the 
gold for renewed chatting and AC-droppings.  However, after confirming with my
stethoscope that my priest was carrying the aforementioned amount, it turned
out that when I searched the corpse he had only 10,000 and change.  What's going
on?  Why do those zorkmids simply disappear?  That was a potential of another
10 AC points gone but the gold simply wasn't there, no message, no nothing.

Anyway, did anyone ever notice that sometimes his level was being swarmed by
gremlins?  It turns out that if a gremlin walks into water (fountain, pool or moat)
that another gremlin appears, just like in the movie.  Nice touch, dev team!

My biggest grieve lately has been that I had a Medic and the first thing I found was
'a wide sword named Stormbringer.'  It was the first room I walked into!  So he was
zooming up the levels at a nice rate but then encountereda Treasure zoo at level 10
or so.  I went of to hack and slash and after a couple of moves a nymph stole 
the heavy iron ball I was chained to.  Great, I thought.  I killed a couple more beasts
and then antoher nymph stole my sword.  Aaaargh!  Back to my scalpel but I wasn't able
to regenerate faster than the other monsters (an Ogre Lord I was trying to kill most
notably) and after a while I died, robbed absolutely blind by three nymphs.  Sigh.
In my mind I had almost beaten Mr. Wiz with my fabulous weapon, and then that happens
to me.

If you wanna react to any of these don't hesitate to do so but please mail me 'coz I'll
be taking a cruise next week and all will be expired by the time I'll be back.

Happy hacking, Willem.
